# Preserve exact bytes: saved experiment manifests use SHA-256 of source/report files.
# Automatic LF/CRLF conversion would invalidate those provenance checks on checkout.
* -text
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Matplotlib emits harmless spaces in multiline SVG path coordinates.
*.svg -whitespace
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
